      {
        "text": "\n\n3 ",
        "color": "$text"
      },
      {
        "text": "5 max stacks, 4% Movement Speed per stack, stacking every 3 seconds. 8 Radius with 160% Knockback.",
        "color": "#E9C375"
      },
      {
        "text": "\n\n",
        "color": "$text"
      },
      {
        "text": "Overlevels to <gold>Momentum Engine<white> add <yellow>0.1 second charge reduction <white>and <yellow>increased knockback and size",
